{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o011a","title":"销御府金银物供军用","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o011a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"销御府金银物供军用","evidence":["shaodi-e-o011a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0129","role":"下诏","evidence":["shaodi-e-o011a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":240,"label":"秋七月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y240","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o008","basis":"秋七月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o011a-q","shaodi-q-o008","shaodi-q-o012","shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o011a-q","source_order":[4,43,"O011a"],"order":998}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0129","name":"曹芳","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o011a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-3a8dd07b7d7a310709ae","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，诏曰：“《易》称‘损上益下〖10〗’，‘节以制度〖11〗，不伤财，不害民’。方今百姓不足，而御府多作金银杂物〖12〗，将奚以为〖13〗？今出黄金银物百五十种，千八百余斤，销冶以供军用。”八月，车驾巡省洛阳界秋稼〖14〗，赐高年、力田各有差。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：正始二年（公元 241）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf9ccbeb544f540e6afb","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o008","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-44ec00442cdb41f1ea33","layer":"original","quote":"正始元年春二月，乙丑〖1〗，加侍中、中书监刘放，侍中、中书令孙资为左、右光禄大夫〖2〗。丙戌〖3〗，以辽东汶、北丰县民流徙渡海〖4〗，规齐郡之西安、临菑、昌国县界，为新汶、南丰县〖5〗，以居流民。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o012","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33e60ac0c003858f0640","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，帝初通《论语》〖2〗。使太常以太牢祭孔子于辟雍〖3〗，以颜渊配〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
